# Beginnings' edges: the offer's operands, each false alone, and the accepted arms the main flow leaves. bob: no
# Immortal Sentries: not offered: An Empty Vessel's 78; then accepted by a GM with 500 gil: 706 (500), option 1: under
# 1000 gil: nothing. carl: An Empty Vessel not completed: not offered: An Empty Vessel's own available 60 (level 40 >=
# 30); its mustZone (a GM): An Empty Vessel's 63 (an Event: an offered 705 would beat it). dan: a Thief (neither Blue
# Mage nor Warrior): not offered: 78; accepted by a GM: a Thief: no section 2: 78; Meyaada: no section: her script
# 4 (a fresh char's ToAU mission is not at or past President Salaheem). ed: a level 39 Blue Mage: not offered: 78, also
# at AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 39.4 (the setting read as a number). fred: An Empty Vessel's completeEvent 1: not offered: An
# Empty Vessel's 69, twice (an offered 705 would tie and rotate in). Main: accepted (a GM) with the five brands (GMs): each brand taken alone (a GM): 706; a full bag:
# 707's quest:complete false (the scimitar does not fit): nothing, still accepted; room again: 707: completed.
